Assume that X and Y are non-zero positive integers. What does the following Pascal program segment do? while X <> Y do
if  X > Y then
    X := X - Y
else
    Y := Y - X;
write(X);

What is the value of X printed by the following program? program COMPUTE (input, output);
var X:integer;
procedure FIND (X:real);
    begin
        X:=sqrt(X);
    end;
begin
    X:=2
    FIND(X);
    writeln(X);
end.
